# One attack key of $P's creature wounds a fresh red fox, in three tries.
# Parameters: P (player letter), key (PrimaryAttack, SecondaryAttack or Dodge), at (distance to strike from), gap (seconds between tries).

# Back to dry ground first: every fight ends a few steps east, and the bear cannot reach a fox in the water.
$P tp $spot
$P spawn RedFox 60 0
$P expect health RedFox == 500/500 timeout=30
# The root trap holds the fox still, so the attacks are tested, not the aim.
$P effect add StatusEffect_RootTrap_Root RedFox
$P tpnear RedFox $at 0
$P look RedFox
$P expect press $key 0.2 !contains "Stunned" timeout=10
sleep $gap
$P tpnear RedFox $at 0
$P look RedFox
$P expect press $key 0.2 !contains "Stunned" timeout=10
sleep $gap
$P tpnear RedFox $at 0
$P look RedFox
$P expect press $key 0.2 !contains "Stunned" timeout=10
$P expect health RedFox !contains "500/500" timeout=6
$P hit RedFox 9999 pure
